@baseUrl = http://localhost:5065
@submissionId = b350e2b9-7ab4-45e8-a49b-00d354e4a95c

### Create or replay this logical submission (201 with the same order and Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{submissionId}}

{
  "supplierCode": "ACME",
  "notes": "Replay example",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "BOLT-10", "description": "Hex bolt", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 0.35 }
  ]
}

### Conflicting reuse of the same identity (409); choose a new UUID for a new order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{submissionId}}

{
  "supplierCode": "ACME",
  "notes": "Replay example",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "BOLT-10", "description": "Hex bolt", "quantity": 11, "unitPrice": 0.35 }
  ]
}

### All duplicate purchase orders, including their full saved details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-orders/duplicates
